{"id":"2.6.3.4","doc":"T","title":"Interrupt Instructions","words":301,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"All these interrupt instructions are standard R-type instructions, with the same OpCode of custom0 (0001011)."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Figure 2.6-1 shows the format of standard R-type instructions."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note the fields funct3 (f3) and rs2 are ignored in these instructions."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_6-1.png","alt":"Figure 2.6-1. Standard R-type Instruction Format"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction: getq rd,qs"}]}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This instruction copies the value of Q"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]},{"t":"text","v":" into a general purpose register rd."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_6-2.png","alt":"Figure 2.6-2. Interrupt Instruction - getq rd, qs"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.6-2):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"rd"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Target general purpose register, holds the value of interrupt register specified by qs."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"qs"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Address of interrupt register Q"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"f7"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Interrupt instruction number."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction: setq qd,rs"}]}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This instruction copies the value of general purpose register rs to Q"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_6-3.png","alt":"Figure 2.6-3. Interrupt Instruction - setq qd,rs"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.6-3):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"qd"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Target interrupt register"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"rs"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Source general purpose register, stores the value to be written to interrupt register."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"f7"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Interrupt instruction number."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction: retirq"}]}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This instruction copies the value of Q0 to CPU PC, and enables interrupt again."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-2_6-4.png","alt":"Figure 2.6-4. Interrupt Instruction - retirq"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.6-4):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"f7"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Interrupt instruction number."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Instruction: maskirq rd,rs"}]}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":21,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This instruction copies the value of the register IRQ Mask to the register rd, and copies the value of register rs to IRQ Mask."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":22,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Figure 2.6-5."}]},{"n":23,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Interrupt Instruction — Maskirq rd rs (no captioned figure image is available for this drawing; fields: f7 = 0000011, rs2 ignored, rs, f3 ignored, rd, OpCode 0001011.)"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":24,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Operand description (see Figure 2.6-5):"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":25,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"rd"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Target general purpose register, stores current value of register Q1."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":26,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"rs"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Source general purpose register, stores the value to be written to Q1."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":27,"c":[{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"f7"}]},{"t":"text","v":": Interrupt instruction number."}]}]}]]}]}